In article <HEB.94Jan5120740@krynn.solace.mh.se>, heb@krynn.solace.mh.se (Henrik Bylund) writes:
>If it's new moon / full moon, the 'zero' mentioned above is increased/decreased
>by one, so if it's new moon, your luck will move towards -1 instead of 0.
>If it's full moon, and you're having a uncursed/blessed luckstone, your luck
>will move towards +4 instead.

If it's a full moon your luck moves towards +1 instead of zero.  If you get
to +1 luck, and then pick up a blessed/uncursed luckstone, your luck will 
be +4.  Once you've got the luckstone, you luck won't change with time.

Clear?
